#!/usr/bin/env node
// mem — CLI entrypoint, and the only complete one: the maintenance tier lives
// here and nowhere else. Costs zero context until invoked, and pays the
// embedding model load on every invocation to keep it that way.
//
// mcp/mem/server.mjs exposes the seven driven commands as tools over the same
// src/ modules, where a long-lived process amortises that load instead. Both
// render through src/format.mjs so a memory reads back identically either way.

